[00:09.36]I've tried the going out, running 'round with the party crowd
[00:09.36]我试过 出门寻欢 参加各种派对狂欢
[00:13.80]Yeah, I was acting like that heartbreak didn't mean a thing
[00:13.80]我装作 那场心碎对我没有任何影响
[00:18.14]I've tried the burning it up and the shutting it down
[00:18.14]我试过借酒消愁 也试过失联静心
[00:22.73]Look how that turned out
[00:22.73]结果都一样
[00:25.49]I've done everything
[00:25.49]除了向这心痛缴械投降
[00:29.03]But giving in to the pain
[00:29.03]我已经试过一切办法
[00:32.29]So tonight
[00:32.29]所以今晚
[00:34.14]I ain't gonna smile like it ain't hurting
[00:34.14]我不会再面带微笑 装作我的心依旧完好
[00:38.59]I'm not drinking nothing but some straight-up bourbon
[00:38.59]我不会再点其他酒 只喝纯饮波本威士忌
[00:42.94]I ain't gonna lie, I'm so lonesome I could cry
[00:42.94]我不会再自欺欺人 我好孤独 好想哭一场
[00:46.97]I'm gonna pour it out to the dive bartender
[00:46.97]我要把心中的苦都倒给廉价酒吧的酒保
[00:51.37]Ain't going to the house 'til I forget to remember
[00:51.37]直到我忘掉所有回忆 我才会回家
[00:55.94]Ever since you left, I've been trying to paint it red
[00:55.94]自从你离开 我一直在试着用积极的红填满生活
[01:00.60]But tonight, I'm doing something new
[01:00.60]但今晚 我要改变策略
